# Names for local dev (PLAN 5.5). Names only: the real file is ~/.pekkah/local.env, outside
# the repo, and I fill the values myself. Apps read it in dev (path overridable with
# PEKKAH_ENV_FILE). Values with spaces go in double quotes. Empty means unset.

